        { q: "Are there cannabis dispensaries in Millinocket, Maine?", a: "Yes. Millinocket has three medical dispensaries: Magic City Med Shop (166 Central St), West Branch Wellness (256 Penobscot Ave), and Outer Limits Med Shop (200 Iron Bridge Road). All three serve registered MMMP patients." },
