        { q: "What is the closest dispensary to Baxter State Park?", a: "Millinocket is the closest dispensary cluster to Baxter State Park and the Abol Bridge / Katahdin trailheads. The town's three dispensaries all serve the Millinocket–East Millinocket corridor and Katahdin-region visitors." },
